    · exact candidate23DiscriminantBlock15
    · exact candidate23DiscriminantBlock16
    · exact candidate23DiscriminantBlock17
    · exact candidate23DiscriminantBlock18
    · exact candidate23DiscriminantBlock19
    · exact candidate23DiscriminantBlock20
    · exact candidate23DiscriminantBlock21
    · exact candidate23DiscriminantBlock22
    · exact candidate23DiscriminantBlock23
    · exact candidate23DiscriminantBlock24
    · exact candidate23DiscriminantBlock25
